{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not terminalize ordinary root SerDes failures.** This catch covers `config.getSerDes().serialize(result)`, so plain `SerDesException` instances\u2014and even `Error`\u2014that previously escaped the invocation are now passed to `handleExecutionFailure` and generally returned as a terminal failed execution. Limit this handling to `PayloadOffloadException`, preserve the previous propagation for non-payload serializer failures, and add a regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7oi1dz","finding_digest":"e1fcd7c4848e7c1ca0b6b864e696af166f64f9a007ca5ab67d9ea2e9ba8b08b5","finding_id":"arf_v1_4h6npreerz6bzifwxbsonfvpcz","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::execute::root-serdes-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::execute::root-serdes-failure-classification","line":146,"observation_digest":"167b313987e1bc21e461fede59c0f334d76a11d7cd803b48e07ecbdde714bc40","observation_id":"aro_v1_cz5tcomh4g6cdzdb73pftqhtgt","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T06:43:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5brtal6bqo5tfbesd2dgzv5oxd","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"7fd5e7e346bcabf0324e23374e3b499628f3cc2d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":146,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_geq6n4ceswdousnfgqmiioudy5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T06:43:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
